<section class="comparison-section" id="comparison">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-tag">The PawPawDoo Difference</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Why Cheap Supermarket Beds Hurt Your Dog</h2>
      <p class="section-desc">Most dog beds flatten in 2 weeks, leaving your dog's joints resting on hard, cold floors. Here's why PawPawDoo is built different.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="comparison-grid">
      
      <!-- Bad -->
      <div class="comparison-card bad">
        <div class="comp-header">
          <span class="comp-badge bad-badge">❌ Generic Supermarket Beds</span>
        </div>
        <ul class="comp-list">
          <li><span class="icon-bad">✕</span> <span>Cheap recycled polyfill that flattens in 14 days.</span></li>
          <li><span class="icon-bad">✕</span> <span>No neck or spine support, leading to joint pain & stiffness.</span></li>
          <li><span class="icon-bad">✕</span> <span>Impossible to wash — traps fur, slobber, and foul odors.</span></li>
          <li><span class="icon-bad">✕</span> <span>Slides dangerously across tile and hardwood floors.</span></li>
          <li><span class="icon-bad">✕</span> <span>No warranty or trial — money wasted if dog ignores it.</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Good -->
      <div class="comparison-card good">
        <div class="comp-header">
          <span class="comp-badge good-badge">✓ PawPawDoo Orthopedic Cloud Bed</span>
        </div>
        <ul class="comp-list">
          <li><span class="icon-good">✓</span> <span>High-density orthopedic memory foam that never sinks to the floor.</span></li>
          <li><span class="icon-good">✓</span> <span>360° calming bolsters provide full neck, head, and spinal alignment.</span></li>
          <li><span class="icon-good">✓</span> <span>100% machine-washable with zippered waterproof odor shield.</span></li>
          <li><span class="icon-good">✓</span> <span>High-traction non-skid silicone bead gripper base.</span></li>
          <li><span class="icon-good">✓</span> <span>30-Night "Tail-Wagging" 100% Money-Back Guarantee.</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

